      <aside class="space-y-6 mt-8 lg:mt-0"><div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">速查参考</h3><ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1"><li><strong>产品：</strong>开源有状态 agent runtime</li><li><strong>许可：</strong>Apache-2.0（可自托管）</li><li><strong>免费档：</strong>$0/月，3 个 agent，BYOK</li><li><strong>Pro：</strong>$20/月，20 个 agent，Letta Auto 额度</li><li><strong>Developer Plan：</strong>API key 按量，无 agent 上限</li><li><strong>服务端工具：</strong>$0.00015 / 秒 CPU</li><li><strong>记忆块：</strong>core / archival / recall</li><li><strong>GitHub 星：</strong>24,000+（letta-ai/letta）</li></ul></div><div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">{affiliateSidebar.title}</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">{affiliateSidebar.description}</p><a href={affiliateSidebar.url} class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-blue-700">{affiliateSidebar.cta}</a></div></aside>
